ceUrl":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/440540/","fetchedAt":"2026-10-16T09:16:13.232429+00:00","locales":{"en":{"status":"source","provider":"steam","shortDescription":"Explore a breathtaking world floating above the clouds in this classic fantasy RPG. Battle an ancient vampire menace, forge powerful bonds with your companions, and experience the definitive Enhanced Edition packed with new content and improvements.","detailedDescription":"\"Long, long ago, the elven sorcerers cast a spell to save the floating world of Ara Fell from destruction. Instead, they doomed it to fall from the sky.\n\nNow, the fate of the world rests in the hands of Lita, a young, spirited archer from the village of Aloria. Joined by a band of loyal companions, she must uncover the truth behind an ancient curse, confront a rising vampire menace, and race against time to save her homeland before Ara Fell is lost forever.\"\n\nAra Fell: Enhanced Edition blends the storytelling and character-driven charm of classic Japanese RPGs with the freedom and exploration of Western RPGs, alongside elements of visual novels and adventure games. Join Lita and a memorable cast of companions on an emotional journey through a breathtaking world in the sky, where every character brings their own past, motivations, and personal struggles to the adventure.\n\nThe Enhanced Edition is the definitive way to experience Ara Fell, featuring a revamped battle system, new character classes and skills, additional side quests, an overhauled crafting and enchanting system, a redesigned UI, autosave, new difficulty options, widescreen support, Twitch integration, and numerous gameplay improvements throughout.\n\n• \nEXPLORATION - Ara Fell is a world meant to be explored! Jump, crawl, swim and even fly through the air to solve puzzles and discover new locations filled with hidden treasure, secrets and adventure! Every corner of Ara Fell is designed with exploration in mind.\n\n• \nOPEN WORLD - Most of the world can be explored from the moment you leave Aloria Village, the heroine's home town... provided, of course, you're strong enough. A clever explorer may be able unlock secrets and discover powerful equipment early in the game if he or she commits to taking advantage of the open nature of the game world.\n\n• \nTACTICAL COMBAT - Ara Fell may be a story-heavy game, but the world is still fraught with danger. Choose specialized equipment and statistics, customizing each character to best suit your play style, and to best thwart each boss battle's unique mechanics.\n\n• \nCHARACTER DRIVEN - When you join Ara Fell's unwitting heroine on her quest to save her homeland, you'll discover a world filled with vibrant characters who laugh, cry, crack jokes, lose their tempers, and even their will to go on as the size and scope of the curse that plagues Ara Fell becomes apparent. Friends and villains alike are not who they seem as the stakes grow ever higher...","aboutGame":null},"vi":{"status":"pending_translation","provider":null,"shortDescription":null,"detailedDescription":null,"aboutGame":null}},"media":{"images":[{"role":"header","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/440540/header.jpg?t=1785135162"},{"role":"capsule","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/440540/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785135162"},{"role":"description","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/440540/extras/40e4a792dd9b4e8dbbf34a4dcf1b0439.avif?t=1785135162","alt":""},{"role":"description","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/440540/extras/beaf8df92e7a111268f137d2a558171d.avif?t=1785135162","alt":""}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/440540/ss_a7f8bbf3e7509bc8426fd94873daedfc19141899.600x338.jpg?t=1785135162","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/440540/ss_a7f8bbf3e7509bc8426